  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Rattle_Eye.jpg\" title=\"Rattle Eye\"><img alt=\"Rattle Eye\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"178\" src=\"/images/Rattle_Eye.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Rattle_Eye.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Rattle Eye</div></div></div>\n<p>Rattle eye is a <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\">Whisker Blademaster</a> Champion who is found on Level 2 of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>.  He is one of the objects of the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_Kinfolk\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Kinfolk\">Rattle Tooth's Kinfolk</a> given by the <a href=\"/wiki/Townston_Commander\" title=\"Townston Commander\">Townston Commander</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
